<title>CANADA: NOVA, NGC in Canada natgas restructuring.</title>
<headline>NOVA, NGC in Canada natgas restructuring.</headline>
<byline>Jeffrey Jones</byline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calgary-based NOVA Corp and NGC Corp of Houston are set to announce a major restructuring of their Canadian natural gas holdings that will see the firms' Novagas Clearinghouse Ltd unit split into three entities, spokespersons from NOVA and NGC confirmed late Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We told our employees that we are looking at a reorganisation of the whole NCL company, which is currently jointly owned by NGC and NOVA,&quot; NOVA's Paul Clark told Reuters.</p>
</text>
